# This repository publishes the payload, the APR Emu assets it installs, the
# README and the image the README shows. Everything else -- sources, build
# output, tools -- stays local.
/*
!.gitignore
!README.md
!apr_emu_updater.elf
!apr-emu/
!assets/
assets/*
!assets/banner.png
!apr_emu_manifest.json